+     * </p>
+     * <ul>
+     * <li>Hayward, Ryan; McDiarmid, Colin (1991).
+     * <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20160205023201/http://www.stats.ox.ac.uk/__data/assets/pdf_file/0015/4173/heapbuildjalg.pdf">
